## 3. Recommended Funnel Architecture

### The Optimized Conversion Funnel

```
AWARENESS → TRUST → INTEREST → DESIRE → ACTION → NURTURE
```

```mermaid
graph TD
    A["🟢 HERO: Full-screen video/slider + Clear Value Prop"] --> B["⭐ TRUST BAR: RERA | Awards | 2400+ Residents | 15 Yrs"]
    B --> C["🏠 FEATURED PROPERTIES: 3 Cards + Urgency Badges"]
    C --> D["💬 TESTIMONIALS: 4-6 Reviews BEFORE Form"]
    D --> E["🎯 MICRO-CONVERSION: 2-Field Quick Inquiry or WhatsApp"]
    E --> F["🔍 INTERACTIVE EXPLORER: Quality Showcase"]
    F --> G["🏆 AMENITIES BENTO: Lifestyle Visualization"]
    G --> H["📋 FULL BOOKING FORM: For High-Intent Users"]
    H --> I["🛡️ SERVICES + FAQ INLINE: Objection Handling"]
    I --> J["📞 FOOTER: Contact + Newsletter Signup"]
    
    K["📲 FLOATING FAB: WhatsApp + Call"] -.-> E
    L["🚪 EXIT INTENT: Guide Download"] -.-> E
```

### Key Changes vs Current Funnel:

| Current Order | Optimized Order | Reason |
|---|---|---|
| 1. Hero | 1. Hero | Same |
| 2. About/Vision | 2. **Trust Bar** (NEW) | Trust before exploration |
| 3. Properties | 3. Properties | Same |
| 4. Interactive | 4. **Testimonials** (moved UP) | Social proof before form |
| 5. Amenities | 5. **Quick Inquiry** (NEW) | Low-friction micro-conversion |
| 6. Booking Form | 6. Interactive | Engagement after micro-conversion |
| 7. Services | 7. Amenities | Same |
| 8. Testimonials | 8. **Full Booking Form** (for high-intent) | Full form for ready buyers |
| 9. Footer | 9. Services + Inline FAQ | Objection handling |
| — | 10. Footer | Same |

