## 4. Specific Design Recommendations (AI-Parseable Specifications)

### 4.1 New Component: `TrustBar`

```
Component: TrustBar
Pattern: Horizontal Logo/Badge Strip
Position: Between Hero and PropertyGrid
Layout: Flex row, center-aligned, gap-12
Items:
  - "RERA Registered" with shield icon
  - "48+ Projects Completed" with counter animation
  - "2,400+ Happy Residents" with counter animation
  - "15 Years of Excellence" with badge
  - Press logos: (Economic Times, Forbes India, etc.)
Background: zinc-50
Border: top/bottom 1px zinc-200
Typography: 10px uppercase tracking-[0.3em] bold zinc-600
Animation: whileInView fade-in stagger 0.1s
```

### 4.2 New Component: `FloatingCTA`

```
Component: FloatingCTA (Sticky Floating Action Button)
Pattern: FAB (Floating Action Button) with expandable menu
Position: Fixed bottom-8 right-8, z-50
State 1 (collapsed): Single WhatsApp-green circle icon (56px)
State 2 (expanded): Stack of 3 circles (WhatsApp, Phone, Email)
Animation: Spring scale + stagger
Mobile: Always visible, slightly smaller (48px)
Desktop: Visible after 50vh scroll
```

### 4.3 Redesigned: [BookingSection](file:///d:/KIIT-MUN/rathore-developers/components/BookingSection.tsx#7-138) → Two-Phase Form

```
Component: BookingSectionV2
Pattern: Step-Wise Progressive Disclosure Form
Phase 1 (above the fold):
  - Heading: "Interested? Let's talk."
  - Fields: Phone Number + Property Interest (dropdown)
  - CTA: "Get a Callback in 30 Minutes"
  - Trust micro-copy: "No spam. Direct line to your property advisor."
Phase 2 (shown after Phase 1 submitted, or for high-intent users):
  - Full form: Name, Email, Date, Notes
  - CTA: "Confirm Your Private Viewing"
```

### 4.4 Enhanced: `PropertyCard` Urgency Elements

```
Additions to each PropertyCard:
  - "Only X units left" counter badge (red text if < 5)
  - "Y people viewed this week" social indicator
  - Status badge colors:
    - "Selling Now" → emerald-500 bg
    - "Limited Units" → amber-500 bg + pulse animation
    - "Coming Soon" → blue-500 bg
    - "Pre-Launch" → purple-500 bg + "Get Notified" mini-CTA
```

### 4.5 New Component: `StickyMobileCTA`

```
Component: StickyMobileCTA
Pattern: Fixed Bottom Bar (Mobile Only)
Visibility: md:hidden, shown on property detail pages
Layout: Full-width, fixed bottom-0, flex row
Left: Price display (₹12.4 Cr)
Right: Two buttons — "Call Now" (phone icon) + "Schedule Visit" (primary)
Background: white with top border + shadow-lg
z-index: 40
Height: 72px
```

### 4.6 New Component: `GlobalConversionModal`

```
Component: GlobalConversionModal
Pattern: Overlay Modal with Backdrop Blur
Trigger: Navbar "Schedule a Visit" button (all pages)
Content: Condensed booking form (Name, Phone, Property, Date)
Animation: Fade in + scale from 0.95
Backdrop: bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-md
Close: X button, ESC key, backdrop click
Features: Pre-select property if opened from property detail page
```

